✔ a diagram the rules cannot make valid is left exactly as written for the one repair; a valid one is untouched (17.1292ms)
✔ the corrections run before any repair, one log line each, and their count is saved on the card (886.3513ms)
✔ the last-resort simplified diagram takes its kind from the learner's words: cycle for repeat words, sequence for messages between named actors, else flow (58.936ms)
✔ flow_to_sequence: a handshake and a 3-party exchange drawn as straight flows become sequences, the trailing outcome kept as the caption (3.2076ms)
✔ flow_to_sequence never fires on a single-actor pipeline, a flow with a decision, a non-message step or an ambiguous receiver (2.2915ms)
✔ flow_to_sequence is logged and counted on the card like the other corrections, and a learner who named a flow keeps it (48.7402ms)
✔ sampling: the author call is temperature 0 with a seed only where the provider documents one; the repair carries the problem and samples at 0.3, unseeded (7.2178ms)
✔ M5: parallel input starts that converge (the real attention flow) are joined under a fork, not a decision (5.4897ms)
✔ M3: undeclared keys in the visuals are stripped and logged on every route; a clean answer is untouched (217.9032ms)
✔ E3: bare maths in diagram text is logged and counted on the card, never repaired (95.6541ms)
{"event":"explanation_diagram_dropped_element","kind":"matrix cells","label":"A","reason":"trailing cells removed: z"}
