✔ the raw author visuals are logged in dev and test, for the first answer and the repair, and never in production (589.6734ms)
✔ C1.1: relationships are drawn as graphs, each node once; a disconnected one keeps the pairs layout (237.7661ms)
✔ a plain dated timeline sent with scaled-lanes and empty lanes becomes the plain timeline, without a repair (9.0607ms)
✔ a teaching matrix without row IDs gets them; cell counts are padded or trimmed only when unambiguous (80.0548ms)
✔ field corrections: too-long text is cut at a word, blank or multi-line optional text is cleaned, a mapping index to a missing item is dropped; anything else is left for the repair (59.5038ms)
✔ long paragraphs are split before the layout check, so a visual that ended the card finds a gap between prose (Gemini: "a visual needs prose before and after it") (4.5734ms)
